ven bigger set-pieces. Since their introduction the Minions have become a true global phenomenon?spawning theme-park attractions, viral memes and billions of views online?thanks to their lovable stupidity and unstoppable enthusiasm for mayhem. With its combination of fast-paced comedy and family-friendly adventure, Minions &amp; Monsters promises another wildly entertaining chapter for the most unpredictable characters in modern animation.                </span>\r\n\r\n                <button \r\n                  type=\"button\"\r\n                  class=\"ml-2 text-ompYellow underline text-base\"\r\n                  onclick=\"toggleSynopsis(this)\"\r\n                >\r\n                  See more\r\n                </button>\r\n                          </p>\r\n          <div class=\"hallTypeIcon hidden\">\r\n                                  </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <!-- C -->\r\n      <div class=\"col-span-3 md:col-span-5 md:col-start-1\">\r\n        <div class=\"w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 sm:col-span-2 xl:grid-cols-3  gap-2\">\r\n          <a aria-label=\"Minions and Monsters at 12:50 in Screen 7\" href=\"https://www.omniplexcinemas.co.uk/booking/seats/sutton/44607\" class=\"\"> \r\n<div id=\"perf_0\" class=\"showTimeBox bg-ompGray-times p-2 col-span-1 rounded-xl\">\r\n  <div class=\"topSection flex justify-between items-end\">\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-end\">\r\n      <div class=\"flex items-baseline\">\r\n        <h4 class=\"bigText mr-1 leading-none\" aria-label=\"Minions and Monsters at 12:50 in Screen 7\">\r\n          12:50        </h4>\r\n        <p class=\"smallText leading-none\" aria-label=\"Minions and Monsters starts at 12:50 and ends at 14:15\">\r\n          - 14:15        </p>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-end\">\r\n              <div class=\"flex items-baseline\">\r\n          <p class=\"smallText mr-1 leading-none\" aria-label=\"Cost starting from &pound;6.95\">\r\n    