his triumphs, struggles, and iconic performances, starring his nephew Jaafar ...              </span>\r\n\r\n                              <span class=\"synopsis-full hidden text-base\">\r\n                  A biopic exploring the life of Michael Jackson, from his Jackson 5 beginnings and extraordinary talent to his status as the biggest entertainer, promising an honest look at his triumphs, struggles, and iconic performances, starring his nephew Jaafar Jackson as Michael, with Colman Domingo &amp; Nia Long as his parents, directed by Antoine Fuqua.                </span>\r\n\r\n                <button \r\n                  type=\"button\"\r\n                  class=\"ml-2 text-ompYellow underline text-base\"\r\n                  onclick=\"toggleSynopsis(this)\"\r\n                >\r\n                  See more\r\n                </button>\r\n                          </p>\r\n          <div class=\"hallTypeIcon hidden\">\r\n                                          <img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_dbox-orange.svg\" class=\"h-4 w-auto my-2\" alt=\"Event Type Icon\" />\r\n                                                </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <!-- C -->\r\n      <div class=\"col-span-3 md:col-span-5 md:col-start-1\">\r\n        <div class=\"w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 sm:col-span-2 xl:grid-cols-3  gap-2\">\r\n          <a aria-label=\"Michael at 18:50 in DBOX 12\" href=\"https://www.omniplexcinemas.co.uk/booking/seats/sutton/44618\" class=\"\"> \r\n<div id=\"perf_0\" class=\"showTimeBox bg-ompGray-times p-2 col-span-1 rounded-xl\">\r\n  <div class=\"topSection flex justify-between items-end\">\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-end\">\r\n      <div class=\"flex items-baseline\">\r\n        <h4 class=\"bigText mr-1 leading-none\" aria-label=\"Michael at 18:50 in DBOX 12\">\r\n          18:50        </h4>\r\n        <p class=\"smallText leading-none\" aria-label=\"Michael starts at 18:50 and ends at 20:57\">\