le.svg\"\r\n          alt=\"Play Trailler\"\r\n          class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 self-center justify-self-center w-12 h-12\"\r\n        />\r\n          </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"md:col-span-5 lg:col-span-5 xl:col-span-8\">\r\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4 items-start\">\r\n      <!-- A (Mobile) -->\r\n      <div class=\"md:hidden col-span-1\">\r\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 grid-rows-1 w-full\">\r\n          <img\r\n            src=\"/filmimages/small/102342.jpg?v=1553038351\"\r\n            alt=\"Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu Event poster\"\r\n            class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 w-full h-auto object-cover\"\r\n            data-eventCode=\"102342\"\r\n            data-eventCode=\"Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu\"\r\n          />\r\n                      <img\r\n              onclick=\"playYoutubeVideo('9grTdmar5IA')\"\r\n              src=\"/public/assets/svgs/play-circle.svg\"\r\n              alt=\"Play Trailler\"\r\n              class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 self-center justify-self-center w-12 h-12\"\r\n            />\r\n                  </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <!-- B -->\r\n      <div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"w-full\">\r\n          <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start w-full mb-2\">\r\n            <p class=\"font-medium text-lg sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-snug sm:leading-tight md:leading-tight mr-4\">\r\n              <a href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/star-wars-the-mandalorian-and-grogu\">\r\n                Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu              </a>\r\n            </p>\r\n            <img data-toggle=\"0\" id=\"favourite102342\" onClick=\"toggleFavourite('102342');return false;\" src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_favourited-off.svg\" class=\"w-4 mt-2 mx-3\" alt=\"Add to Favourites\" />  \r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\">\r\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\r\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n                <img src=\"/images/ratings/UK_12A.png\" class=\"w-4 min-w-[30px]\" />\r\n                <p class=\"text-base leading-snug font-normal leading-none\">Action, Adventure</p>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <p class=\"mb-2 md:m-auto flex item-center\"><span class=\"hidden md:flex mr-2\">|</span> 2hrs 12min </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          \r\n            <p class=\"hidden md:block mb-2 pt-2\">\r\n              <span class=\"synopsis-short\">\r\n                The Mandalorian and Grogu embark on their most thrilling mission yet in Lucasfilm?s all-new Star Wars adventure. The evil Empire has fallen, and Imperial warlords remain scattered throughout the galaxy. As the fledgling New Republic works to protect ...              </span>\r\n\r\n                              <span class=\"synopsis-full hidden text-base\">\r\n                  The Mandalorian and Grogu embark on their most thrilling mission yet in Lucasfilm?s all-new Star Wars adventure. The evil Empire has fallen, and Imperial warlords remain scattered throughout the galaxy. As the fledgling New Republic works to protect everything the Rebellion fought for, they have enlisted the help of legendary Mandalorian bounty hunter Djin Djarin and his young apprentice Grogu.                </span>\r\n\r\n                <button \r\n                  type=\"button\"\r\n                  class=\"ml-2 text-ompYellow underline text-base\"\r\n                  onclick=\"toggleSynopsis(this)\"\r\n                >\r\n                  See more\r\n                </button>\r\n                          </p>\r\n          <div class=\"hallTypeIcon hidden\">\r\n                                          <img src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_dbox-orange.svg\" class=\"h-4 w-auto my-2\" alt=\"Event Type Icon\" />\r\n                                                </div>\r\n