era 26-27</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/macbeth-the-met-opera-2026-27\">Macbeth - The Met Opera 2026-27</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/manon-live-the-royal-ballet-26-27\">Manon - LIVE - The Royal Ballet 26-27</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/masters-of-the-universe\">Masters Of The Universe</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/nt-live-the-misanthrope\">NT Live: The Misanthrope</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/paw-patrol-the-dino-movie-medi-cinema-charity-screenings\">Paw Patrol: The Dino Movie: Medi Cinema Charity Screenings</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/romeo-juliet-live-the-royal-ballet-26-27\">Romeo & Juliet - LIVE - The Royal Ballet 26-27</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/spider-man-brand-new-day\">Spider-Man: Brand New Day</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/swan-lake-live-the-royal-ballet-26-27\">Swan Lake - LIVE - The Royal Ballet 26-27</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/the-nutcracker-live-the-royal-ballet-26-27\">The Nutcracker - LIVE - The Royal Ballet 26-27</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/the-odyssey\">The Odyssey</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/the-super-mario-galaxy-movie\">The Super Mario Galaxy Movie</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/tosca-live-the-royal-opera-26-27\">Tosca - LIVE - The Royal Opera 26-27</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-