ime-card\" style=\"background-image: url('https://www.omniplexcinemas.co.uk/cms/The Odyssey Web Slider 2.webp');\"><div class=\"showtime-card-graident\"><div class=\"showtime-card-content\"><h2 class=\"showtime-title mb-2\">The Odyssey</h2><div class=\"showtime-details flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap justify-start\"><a href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/the-odyssey\" class=\"!mx-px btn-solid-yellow showtime-button\">Book now</a><span class=\"showtime-age-rating flex-shrink-0\"><img title=\"BBFC - 15\" class=\"showtime-age-rating-img\" src=\"/images/ratings/UK_15.png\" /></span><span class=\"showtime-genre\">Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy</span></div></div></div></div>                  <div class=\"splide__slide showtime-card\" style=\"background-image: url('https://www.omniplexcinemas.co.uk/cms/Spider Man Brand New Day Web Slider 2.webp');\"><div class=\"showtime-card-graident\"><div class=\"showtime-card-content\"><h2 class=\"showtime-title mb-2\">Spider-Man: Brand New Day</h2><div class=\"showtime-details flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap justify-start\"><a href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/spider-man-brand-new-day\" class=\"!mx-px btn-solid-yellow showtime-button\">Book now</a><span class=\"showtime-age-rating flex-shrink-0\"><img title=\"BBFC - 12A (TBC)\" class=\"showtime-age-rating-img\" src=\"/images/ratings/UK_TBC.png\" /></span><span class=\"showtime-genre\">Action</span></div></div></div></div>              </ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"main-container\" style=\"background-color: transparent\">\r\n  <div id=\"showtimes_section\" class=\"w-full flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between\">\r\n    <div class=\"flex w-full\">\r\n      <div class=\"mb-mid flex items-center w-full justify-between md:justify-start\">\r\n        <!-- <h1 class=\"page-title text-white mr-4\">Now showing in</h1> -->\r\n        <div class=\"\">\r\n          <div class=\"flex items-center\"><a href=\"/cinema/site\" class=\"js-site-link\"><span class=\"menu-location pr-1 py-1 text-2xl font-semibold\">Sutton Surrey</span><i class=\"icon omni-chevron-down mx-1 text-xl cursor-pointer\"></i></a></div>        </div>\r\n        <a href=\"/company/about\" class=\" pl-3 text-ompYellow\">About this venue</a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"w-full lg:w-auto\">\r\n      <div class=\"flex items-center mb-mid block md:hidden\">\r\n        <p class=\"text-base\">Filter movies & events</p>\r\n        <i id=\"filterButton\" class=\"icon omni-filter mx-3 text-lg\"></i>\r\n        <i onclick=\"showSearchBox()\" id=\"showSearchBarButton\" class=\"icon omni-search mx-3 text-lg\"></i>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div>\r\n        <div id=\"searchBoxContainer\" class=\"mb-4 pt-2 hidden md:block\">\r\n          <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\r\n            <div class=\"input-search\">\r\n              <i class=\"icon omni-search\" style=\"position: static;\"></i>\r\n              <input style=\"left: 10px;\" id=\"searchBarInput\" onkeyup=\"searchForPerformance()\" placeholder=\"Movie Search\" type=\"text\" />\r\n              <div class=\"flex absolute bg-ompGray z-[40]\"><ul id=\"performanceList\"><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/moana\">Moana</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/moana-sing-along-\">Moana (Sing along)</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/toy-story-5\">Toy Story 5</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/evil-dead-burn\">Evil Dead Burn</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/supergirl\">Supergirl</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/minions-and-monsters\">Minions and Monsters</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/the-invite\">The Invite</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/jackass-best-and-last\">Jackass: Best and Last</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/disclosure-day\">Disclosure Day</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/michael\">Michael</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/star-wars-the-mandalorian-and-grogu\">Star Wars: The Mandalorian and Grogu</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/alices-adventures-in-wonderland-live-the-royal-ballet-26-27\">Alices Adventures In Wonderland - LIVE - The Royal Ballet 26-27</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/andre-rieu-s-2026-summer-concert-viva-maastricht-\">Andre Rieu's 2026 Summer Concert: Viva Maastricht!</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/animal-farm\">Animal Farm</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/carmen-live-the-royal-opera-26-27\">Carmen - LIVE- The Royal Opera 26-27</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/cosi-fan-tutte-live-the-royal-opera-26-27\">Cosi Fan Tutte - LIVE - The Royal Opera 26-27</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/gotterdammerung-live-the-royal-opera-26-27\">Gotterdammerung - LIVE - The Royal Opera 26-27</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/james-getting-away-with-it-live-premiere-performance\">James: Getting Away With It + Live Premiere Performance</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/la-fanciulla-del-west-the-met-opera-26-27\">La Fanciulla Del West - The Met Opera 26-27</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/macbeth-the-met-opera-2026-27\">Macbeth - The Met Opera 2026-27</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/manon-live-the-royal-ballet-26-27\">Manon - LIVE - The Royal Ballet 26-27</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/masters-of-the-universe\">Masters Of The Universe</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/nt-live-the-misanthrope\">NT Live: The Misanthrope</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/paw-patrol-the-dino-movie-medi-cinema-charity-screenings\">Paw Patrol: The Dino Movie: Medi Cinema Charity Screenings</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/romeo-juliet-live-the-royal-ballet-26-27\">Romeo & Juliet - LIVE - The Royal Ballet 26-27</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/spider-man-brand-new-day\">Spider-Man: Brand New Day</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/swan-lake-live-the-royal-ballet-26-27\">Swan Lake - LIVE - The Royal Ballet 26-27</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/the-nutcracker-live-the-royal-ballet-26-27\">The Nutcracker - LIVE - The Royal Ballet 26-27</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/the-odyssey\">The Odyssey</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/the-super-mario-galaxy-movie\">The Super Mario Galaxy Movie</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/tosca-live-the-royal-opera-26-27\">Tosca - LIVE - The Royal Opera 26-27</a>  </li><li style=\"display: none;\">  <a class=\"p-3 block\" href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/wham-10-days-in-china\">WHAM! 10 Days In China</a>  </li> </ul> </div>            </div>\r\n            <i id=\"filterButton2\" class=\"icon omni-filter text-ompYellow mx-3 hidden md:block\"></i>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>  \r\n      </div>\r\n      <div id=\"\" class=\"\">\r\n        <div id=\"filterControlls-datescon\">\r\n           \r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"sticky top-0  z-[30]\">\r\n    \r\n  <div id=\"filterControlls-dates\" class=\"main-container-full bg-ompGray-dates\" style=\"padding-left: 0 !important; padding-right: 0 !important; \">\r\n    <div id=\"dateNav\" class=\"date-nav-container mb-mid md:justify-around\" style=\"\">\r\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"date-nav-item\" data-date=\"2026-07-11\">\r\n            <span>Today</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n                  <button type=\"button\" class=\"date-nav-item\" data-date=\"2026-07-12\">\r\n            <span>Sunday</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n                  <button type=\"button\" class=\"date-nav-item\" data-date=\"2026-07-13\">\r\n            <span>Monday</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n                  <button type=\"button\" class=\"date-nav-item\" data-date=\"2026-07-14\">\r\n            <span>Tuesday</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n                  <button type=\"button\" class=\"date-nav-item\" data-date=\"2026-07-15\">\r\n            <span>Wednesday</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n                  <button type=\"button\" class=\"date-nav-item\" data-date=\"2026-07-16\">\r\n            <span>Thursday</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n                  <button type=\"button\" class=\"date-nav-item\" data-date=\"2026-07-17\">\r\n            <span>Friday</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"date-nav-item active\" data-date=\"calendar\" onclick=\"showDateCalendar(); return false;\">\r\n          <span>\r\n            5th May          </span>\r\n        </button>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- <section id=\"dates\" class=\"splide mb-mid py-4 bg-ompGray-slider px-2\">\r\n      <div class=\"splide__track\">\r\n        <ul class=\"splide__list\">\r\n                   \r\n            <li class=\"splide__slide date-item \">\r\n              <a data-target=\"0\" onClick=\"updateSearch('DATE', '2026-07-11');refreshSearch();\">Today</a>\r\n            </li> \r\n                   \r\n            <li class=\"splide__slide date-item \">\r\n              <a data-target=\"1\" onClick=\"updateSearch('DATE', '2026-07-12');refreshSearch();\">Sunday</a>\r\n            </li> \r\n                   \r\n            <li class=\"splide__slide date-item \">\r\n              <a data-target=\"2\" onClick=\"updateSearch('DATE', '2026-07-13');refreshSearch();\">Monday</a>\r\n            </li> \r\n                   \r\n            <li class=\"splide__slide date-item \">\r\n              <a data-target=\"3\" onClick=\"updateSearch('DATE', '2026-07-14');refreshSearch();\">Tuesday</a>\r\n            </li> \r\n                   \r\n            <li class=\"splide__slide date-item \">\r\n              <a data-target=\"4\" onClick=\"updateSearch('DATE', '2026-07-15');refreshSearch();\">Wednesday</a>\r\n            </li> \r\n                   \r\n            <li class=\"splide__slide date-item \">\r\n              <a data-target=\"5\" onClick=\"updateSearch('DATE', '2026-07-16');refreshSearch();\">Thursday</a>\r\n            </li> \r\n                   \r\n            <li class=\"splide__slide date-item \">\r\n              <a data-target=\"6\" onClick=\"updateSearch('DATE', '2026-07-17');refreshSearch();\">Friday</a>\r\n            </li> \r\n                    \r\n          <li class=\"splide__slide date-item active\" ><a data-target=\"6\" href=\"#\" onClick=\"showDateCalendar(); return false;\">5th May</a></li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </section> -->\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <div id=\"calendarModal\" class=\"hidden\">\r\n    <div class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 inset-0 bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm z-[170]\"></div>\r\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 flex justify-center items-center z-[180]\">\r\n      <div class=\"rounded-lg shadow-lg p-6 relative\">\r\n        <input type=\"text\" id=\"calendarPicker\" placeholder=\"Select a date\"\r\n              class=\"hidden w-full border border-gray-300 rounded p-2\" />\r\n        <button class=\"btn-solid-yellow mt-4\" onclick=\"closeCalendarModal()\">Close</button>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <script src=\"/public/js/flatpickr/flatpickr.min.js\"></script>\r\n  <script>\r\n    // Assume allowedDates is provided by PHP as an array of UNIX timestamps\r\n    var defaultDate = \"2027-05-05\";\r\n    const allowedDatesTimestamps = [1783724400000,1783810800000,1783897200000,1783983600000,1784070000000,1784156400000,1784242800000,1784329200000,1784415600000,1784502000000,1784588400000,1784674800000,1784761200000,1805760000000,1786143600000,1786230000000,1794268800000,1803340800000,1801612800000,1786921200000,1800921600000,1792450800000,1793059200000,1790031600000,1790463600000,1785625200000,1811199600000,1785279600000,1785366000000,1785452400000,1785538800000,1785711600000,1785798000000,1785884400000,1785970800000,1808348400000,1796083200000,1809471600000,1785193200000];\r\n    const allowedDates = allowedDatesTimestamps.map(ts => new Date(ts));\r\n    // console.log('DateSelector::AllowedDateCount:39');\r\n    // console.log('DateSelector::CalendarEventCount:32');\r\n    // console.log('DateSelector::AllowedDates:' + allowedDatesTimestamps);\r\n    // console.log('DateSelector::DfltDate:' + defaultDate);\r\n    // console.log('DateSelector::FilterEventCode: ');    \r\n    \r\n    if (defaultDate == 0) {\r\n      defaultDate = '';\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    flatpickr(\"#calendarPicker\", {\r\n      inline: true,\r\n      enable: allowedDates,\r\n      dateFormat: \"Y-m-d\",\r\n      defaultDate: defaultDate,\r\n      onChange: function(selectedDates, dateStr, instance) {\r\n        console.log(\"Selected date:\", dateStr);\r\n        calendarDateChange(dateStr);\r\n        // Optionally, automatically close the modal after selection:\r\n        // closeCalendarModal();\r\n      }\r\n    });\r\n    \r\n  </script>\r\n\r\n  <script> \r\n    var slideIndex = 6;\r\n    console.log(slideIndex);\r\n    \r\n    // document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n    //   var dates = new Splide('#dates', {\r\n    //     type: 'slide',\r\n    //     perPage: 6, // Default: Fully show only 3 slides at a time\r\n    //     perMove: 1, // Move one slide at a time\r\n    //     gap: '5px', // Space between slides\r\n    //     arrows: false, // Hide arrows\r\n    //     pagination: false, // Hide pagination\r\n    //     trimSpace: false, // Prevents unwanted cropping\r\n    //     autoHeight: true, // Adjusts height to content dynamically\r\n    //     rewind: false, // Prevents bouncing back to the first slide\r\n    //     snap: true, // Forces snap to the closest slide\r\n    //     drag: true, // Prevents flick scrolling through multiple items quickly\r\n    //     wheel: false, // Disables fast scrolling with mouse wheel\r\n    //     //focus: 'center',\r\n    //     breakpoints: {\r\n    //       1200: {\r\n    //         perPage: 6\r\n    //       }, // Show 5 slides on larger screens\r\n    //       900: {\r\n    //         perPage: 4\r\n    //       }, // Show 4 slides on medium screens\r\n    //       600: {\r\n    //         perPage: 3\r\n    //       }, // Default: 3 slides on smaller screens\r\n    //     },\r\n    //   });\r\n    \r\n    //   dates.on('mounted', function () {\r\n    //     // Wait for a short timeout to let layout settle\r\n    //     setTimeout(() => {\r\n    //       dates.go(slideIndex);\r\n    //     }, 0); // You can try increasing this to 50–100ms if needed\r\n    //   });\r\n    \r\n    //   // dates.mount();\r\n      \r\n    //   // Log current index on load\r\n    //   console.log('Starting slide index:', dates.index);\r\n    //   console.log('Starting slide selected:', slideIndex);\r\n    \r\n    //   // Log index whenever slide moves\r\n    //   dates.on('moved', function (newIndex) {\r\n    //     console.log('Now showing slide index:', newIndex);\r\n    //   });\r\n    \r\n    //   // Log all slide elements with their indexes\r\n    //   var slides = dates.Components.Slides.get();\r\n    //   slides.forEach((slideObj, index) => {\r\n    //     console.log(`Slide ${index}:`, slideObj.slide.textContent.trim());\r\n    //   });\r\n    // });\r\n    document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function() {\r\n      const searchBar = document.querySelector(\"#filterControlls-search\");\r\n      const filterControls = document.querySelector(\"#filterControlls\");\r\n      var scrollPos = 0;\r\n      window.addEventListener(\"scroll\", function() {\r\n        let scrollTop = window.scrollY || document.documentElement.scrollTop;\r\n        // let filterTop = filterControls.getBoundingClientRect().top;\r\n        \r\n        if (searchBar != null) {\r\n          // searchBar.classList.remove(\"hidden\");\r\n          // if (filterTop <= 35) {\r\n          //   // searchBar.classList.add(\"hidden\");\r\n          // }\r\n        }\r\n      });\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\r\n  const nav      = document.getElementById('dateNav');\r\n  if (!nav) return;\r\n\r\n  const items    = Array.from(nav.querySelectorAll('.date-nav-item'));\r\n  const sections = items.map(btn =>\r\n    document.querySelector(`[data-date-section=\"${btn.dataset.date}\"]`)\r\n  );\r\n\r\n  // Flag to ignore clicks that were actually drags\r\n  let suppressNavClick = false;\r\n\r\n  function setActive(idx) {\r\n    items.forEach((b,i) => b.classList.toggle('active', i === idx));\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  function centerNavItem(btn) {\r\n    const navRect = nav.getBoundingClientRect();\r\n    const btnRect = btn.getBoundingClientRect();\r\n    const offset  = btnRect.left\r\n                  - navRect.left\r\n                  - (navRect.width / 2)\r\n                  + (btnRect.width / 2);\r\n    nav.scrollBy({ left: offset, behavior: 'smooth' });\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  items.forEach((btn, idx) => {\r\n    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n      if (suppressNavClick) return;\r\n\r\n      if (btn.dataset.date === 'calendar') {\r\n        showDateCalendar();\r\n        return;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      sections[idx]?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });\r\n\r\n      // highlight + center in the nav\r\n      setActive(idx);\r\n      centerNavItem(btn);\r\n\r\n      // run your filters\r\n      updateSearch('DATE', btn.dataset.date);\r\n      refreshSearch();\r\n    });\r\n  });\r\n\r\n  const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\r\n    entries.forEach(ent => {\r\n      if (ent.isIntersecting) {\r\n        const idx = sections.findIndex(sec => sec === ent.target);\r\n        if (idx >= 0) {\r\n          setActive(idx);\r\n          centerNavItem(items[idx]);\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    });\r\n  }, {\r\n    rootMargin: '-30% 0px -70% 0px',\r\n    threshold: 0\r\n  });\r\n\r\n  sections.forEach(sec => sec && observer.observe(sec));\r\n\r\n  const initialIdx = items.findIndex(b => b.classList.contains('active'));\r\n  if (initialIdx >= 0) centerNavItem(items[initialIdx]);\r\n\r\n  // --- drag-to-scroll (mouse + touch) that DOESN'T break clicks ---\r\n  (function enableDragScroll(container) {\r\n    let isDown = false;\r\n    let startX = 0;\r\n    let startScrollLeft = 0;\r\n    let dragging = false;\r\n\r\n    const DRAG_THRESHOLD = 10; // px\r\n\r\n    container.style.cursor = 'grab';\r\n\r\n    container.addEventListener('pointerdown', (e) => {\r\n      if (e.pointerType === 'mouse' && e.button !== 0) return;\r\n\r\n      isDown = true;\r\n      dragging = false;\r\n      startX = e.clientX;\r\n      startScrollLeft = container.scrollLeft;\r\n\r\n      container.style.cursor = 'grabbing';\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    container.addEventListener('pointermove', (e) => {\r\n      if (!isDown) return;\r\n\r\n      const dx = e.clientX - startX;\r\n\r\n      if (!dragging && Math.abs(dx) > DRAG_THRESHOLD) {\r\n        dragging = true;\r\n      }\r\n\r\n      if (dragging) {\r\n        if (e.cancelable) e.preventDefault();\r\n        container.scrollLeft = startScrollLeft - dx;\r\n      }\r\n    }, { passive: false });\r\n\r\n    container.addEventListener('pointerup', () => {\r\n      isDown = false;\r\n      container.style.cursor = 'grab';\r\n\r\n      if (dragging) {\r\n        suppressNavClick = true;\r\n        setTimeout(() => { suppressNavClick = false; }, 0);\r\n      }\r\n    });\r\n\r\n    container.addEventListener('pointercancel', () => {\r\n      isDown = false;\r\n      container.style.cursor = 'grab';\r\n    });\r\n  })(nav);\r\n});\r\n\r\n  </script>  </div>\r\n<div class=\"main-container flex items-center text-sm space-x-2 mb-4 text-white/40\">\r\n  <p class=\"inline-flex text-xs items-center justify-center w-4 h-4 bg-white/40 text-black rounded-full\">\r\n    &pound;  </p>\r\n  <p>Booking online is &pound;1.00 cheaper</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"youtubeEmbed\" class=\"overflow-hidden hidden\">\r\n  <div class=\"fixed inset-0 flex items-center justify-center z-50\">\r\n    <div id=\"backgroundOverlay\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n    <div class=\"relative p-6 rounded shadow-lg z-10\">\r\n      <div id=\"youtubeIframe\" class=\"mb-2\">\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div class=\"\">\r\n        <button onclick=\"closeYoutubeVideo()\" class=\"btn-solid-yellow w-full\" onClick=\"closeRemoveFavouriteModal();return false;\">Close</button>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div> \r\n\r\n<div class=\"main-container grid grid-cols-1 gap-6\">\r\n  <!-- main grid  -->\r\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-6 lg:grid-cols-7 xl:grid-cols-10  bg-ompYellow-light/5 shadow-lg backdrop-blur-sm p-4 rounded-lg gap-4 xl:gap-8\">\r\n    <div class=\"hidden md:block col-span-1 md:col-span-1 lg:col-span-2 xl:col-span-2\">\r\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 grid-rows-1 w-full\">\r\n      <img\r\n        src=\"/filmimages/small/110371.jpg?v=1555783405\"\r\n        alt=\"Tosca - LIVE - The Royal Opera 26-27 Event poster\"\r\n        class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 w-full h-auto object-cover\"\r\n        data-eventCode=\"110371\"\r\n        data-eventCode=\"Tosca - LIVE - The Royal Opera 26-27\"\r\n      />\r\n              <img\r\n          onclick=\"playYoutubeVideo('eRR1FiG__FU')\"\r\n          src=\"/public/assets/svgs/play-circle.svg\"\r\n          alt=\"Play Trailler\"\r\n          class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 self-center justify-self-center w-12 h-12\"\r\n        />\r\n          </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"md:col-span-5 lg:col-span-5 xl:col-span-8\">\r\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4 items-start\">\r\n      <!-- A (Mobile) -->\r\n      <div class=\"md:hidden col-span-1\">\r\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 grid-rows-1 w-full\">\r\n          <img\r\n            src=\"/filmimages/small/110371.jpg?v=1555783405\"\r\n            alt=\"Tosca - LIVE - The Royal Opera 26-27 Event poster\"\r\n            class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 w-full h-auto object-cover\"\r\n            data-eventCode=\"110371\"\r\n            data-eventCode=\"Tosca - LIVE - The Royal Opera 26-27\"\r\n          />\r\n                      <img\r\n              onclick=\"playYoutubeVideo('eRR1FiG__FU')\"\r\n              src=\"/public/assets/svgs/play-circle.svg\"\r\n              alt=\"Play Trailler\"\r\n              class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 self-center justify-self-center w-12 h-12\"\r\n            />\r\n                  </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <!-- B -->\r\n      <div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"w-full\">\r\n          <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start w-full mb-2\">\r\n            <p class=\"font-medium text-lg sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-snug sm:leading-tight md:leading-tight mr-4\">\r\n              <a href=\"/cinema/movie/sutton/tosca-live-the-royal-opera-26-27\">\r\n                Tosca - LIVE - The Royal Opera 26-27              </a>\r\n            </p>\r\n            <img data-toggle=\"0\" id=\"favourite110371\" onClick=\"toggleFavourite('110371');return false;\" src=\"/public/assets/svgs/omniplex_mobile-app-2025_svgs_favourited-off.svg\" class=\"w-4 mt-2 mx-3\" alt=\"Add to Favourites\" />  \r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\">\r\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\r\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n                <img src=\"/images/ratings/UK_TBC.png\" class=\"w-4 min-w-[30px]\" />\r\n                <p class=\"text-base leading-snug font-normal leading-none\">Event</p>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <p class=\"mb-2 md:m-auto flex item-center\"><span class=\"hidden md:flex mr-2\">|</span> 3hrs 15min </p>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          \r\n            <p class=\"hidden md:block mb-2 pt-2\">\r\n              <span class=\"synopsis-short\">\r\n                Floria Tosca and Mario Cavaradossi live for each other and for their art. But when Cavaradossi helps an escaped prisoner, the lovers make a deadly enemy in the form of Baron Scarpia, Chief of Police. At the mercy of Scarpia?s twisted desires, Tosca i...              </span>\r\n\r\n                              <span class=\"synopsis-full hidden text-base\">\r\n                  Floria Tosca and Mario Cavaradossi live for each other and for their art. But when Cavaradossi helps an escaped prisoner, the lovers make a deadly enemy in the form of Baron Scarpia, Chief of Police. At the mercy of Scarpia?s twisted desires, Tosca is forced to make a horrific bargain: sleeping with the man she hates, in order to save the man she loves. Can she find a way out?\r\nOliver Mears?s acclaimed production returns, setting Puccini?s operatic thriller in a contemporary, war-torn Rome. Daniel Oren conducts Aleksandra Kurzak, who returns to the title role, joined by Saimir Pirgu as Cavaradossi and Christopher Maltman as Baron Scarpia.                </span>\r\n\r\n                <button \r\n                  type=\"button\"\r\n                  class=\"ml-2 text-ompYellow underline text-base\"\r\n                  onclick=\"toggleSynopsis(this)\"\r\n                >\r\n                  See more\r\n                </button>\r\n                          </p>\r\n          <div class=\"hallTypeIcon hidden\">\r\n                                  </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <!-- C -->\r\n      <div class=\"col-span-3 md:col-span-5 md:col-start-1\">\r\n        <div class=\"w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 sm:col-span-2 xl:grid-cols-3  gap-2\">\r\n          <a aria-label=\"Tosca - LIVE - The Royal Opera 26-27 at 19:00 in Screen 10\" href=\"https://www.omniplexcinemas.co.uk/booking/seats/sutton/42669\" class=\"\"> \r\n<div id=\"perf_0\" class=\"showTimeBox bg-ompGray-times p-2 col-span-1 rounded-xl\">\r\n  <div class=\"topSection flex justify-between items-end\">\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-end\">\r\n      <div class=\"flex items-baseline\">\r\n        <h4 class=\"bigText mr-1 leading-none\" aria-label=\"Tosca - LIVE - The Royal Opera 26-27 at 19:00 in Screen 10\">\r\n          19:00        </h4>\r\n        <p class=\"smallText leading-none\" aria-label=\"Tosca - LIVE - The Royal Opera 26-27 starts at 19:00 and ends at 22:15\">\r\n          - 22:15        </p>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-end\">\r\n              <div class=\"flex items-baseline\">\r\n          <p class=\"smallText mr-1 leading-none\" aria-label=\"Cost starting from &pound;14.95\">\r\n            From\r\n          </p>\r\n          <h4 class=\"bigText leading-none\" aria-label=\"Cost starting from &pound;14.95\">\r\n            &pound;14.95          </h4>\r\n        </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"midSection flex justify-between items-baseline\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"mb-2\"></div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"bottomSection flex justify-between items-baseline\">\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-baseline w-auto\">\r\n      <div class=\"flex items-start w-auto\">\r\n        <p class=\"smallText\">Screen 10</p>\r\n      </div> \r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"flex items-baseline w-auto space-x-2\">\r\n        \r\n    \r\n\r\n</div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</a>          </div>    \r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"main-container my-mid block md:hidden\">\r\n  <button id=\"aboutToggle\" class=\"flex items-center text-ompYellow font-semibold w-full text-left\">\r\n    <p class=\"\">Sutton Surrey Omniplex</p>\r\n    <i id=\"aboutIcon\" class=\"icon omni-chevron-up pl-4\"></i>\r\n  </button>\r\n  <div id=\"aboutSiteSection\" class=\"mt-4 hidden\">\r\n    <div>\r\n      Omniplex Cinema Sutton is a 12-screen cinema in Sutton, surrounded by a great selection of local restaurants, shops and facilities. Check out all of the latest movies and classic re-releases in this modern multiplex. It is the perfect place for lovers of the big screen. \r\n\r\nWhat to expect at Omniplex Cinema Sutton:\r\n\r\nAt Omniplex Cinema Sutton, watch your new favourite movies on our cutting-edge OmniplexMAXX screen. This cinema also features Recline seats, Sofa seats 3D performances, assigned seating and wheelchair-accessibility. Before heading into the screen, stock up on fresh popcorn made on-site, as well as nachos,hotdogs, sweets and soft drinks. We offer free parking for up to 3 hours! Simply ask our cinema staff to stamp your parking ticket.    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"mt-4\">\r\n      </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\n  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {\r\n    const toggle = document.getElementById('aboutToggle');\r\n    const section = document.getElementById('aboutSiteSection');\r\n    const icon = document.getElementById('aboutIcon');\r\n    toggle.addEventListener('click', function () {\r\n      section.classList.toggle('hidden');\r\n      icon.classList.toggle('omni-chevron-down');\r\n      icon.classList.toggle('omni-chevron-up');\r\n    });\r\n  });\r\n\r\nfunction clearFIlters(){\r\n  const clearFiltersButton = document.getElementById('clearFilters');\r\n  clearFiltersButton.click();\r\n}\r\n\r\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\r\n  var showcase = new Splide('#showcase', {\r\n    type: 'loop',\r\n    perPage: 1.2,\r\n    loop: true,\r\n    gap: '20px',\r\n    focus: 'center',\r\n    arrows: false,\r\n    pagination: false,\r\n    trimSpace: false,\r\n    autoHeight: true,\r\n    clones: 2,\r\n    // Auto scroll\r\n    autoplay: true,\r\n    interval: 5000,\r\n    pauseOnHover: true,\r\n    pauseOnFocus: true,\r\n  });\r\n  showcase.mount();\r\n});\r\n\r\nfunction toggleSynopsis(btn) {\r\n  const container = btn.parentElement;\r\n  const shortText = container.querySelector('.synopsis-short');\r\n  const fullText = container.querySelector('.synopsis-full');\r\n\r\n  const isHidden = fullText.classList.contains('hidden');\r\n\r\n  if (isHidden) {\r\n    shortText.classList.add('hidden');\r\n    fullText.classList.remove('hidden');\r\n    btn.textContent = 'See less';\r\n  } else {\r\n    shortText.classList.remove('hidden');\r\n    fullText.classList.add('hidden');\r\n    btn.textContent = 'See more';\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction showSearchBox(){\r\n  const searchBoxContainer =  document.getElementById('searchBoxContainer');\r\n\r\n  searchBoxContainer.classList.toggle('hidden');\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"main-container my-big \">\r\n              <div class=\"grid grid-cols-6 gap-6\">\r\n                      \r\n            <div class=\"col-span-6 md:col-span-2 rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-black\">\r\n              <div\r\n                class=\"h-[300px] flex flex-col justify-end p-6 bg-cover bg-center\"\r\n                style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.7), rgba(0,0,0,0.2)), url('/cms/footerads/opass.png'); background-position: right top;\"\r\n              >\r\n                                  <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-white\">\r\n                    Get a ticket to every movie at Omniplex with a monthly 'MyOmniPass' subscription.                  </h3>\r\n                \r\n                                  <p class=\"text-sm mb-4 text-white\">\r\n                    Terms &amp; Exclusions Apply                  </p>\r\n                \r\n                                  <a\r\n                    href=\"/join/landing\"\r\n                    class=\"text-center font-semibold bg-white/20 hover:bg-white/30 transition px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-sm w-full text-white\"\r\n                  >\r\n                    Find out more                  </a>\r\n                              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n                      \r\n            <div class=\"col-span-6 md:col-span-2 rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-black\">\r\n              <div\r\n                class=\"h-[300px] flex flex-col justify-end p-6 bg-cover bg-center\"\r\n                style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.7), rgba(0,0,0,0.2)), url('/cms/footerads/gcard.png'); background-position: right top;\"\r\n              >\r\n                                  <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-white\">\r\n                    For the superhero in your life...                  </h3>\r\n                \r\n                                  <p class=\"text-sm mb-4 text-white\">\r\n                    Get them an Omniplex Gift Card                  </p>\r\n                \r\n                                  <a\r\n                    href=\"/giftcards/choose\"\r\n                    class=\"text-center font-semibold bg-white/20 hover:bg-white/30 transition px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-sm w-full text-white\"\r\n                  >\r\n                    Get a Gift Card                  </a>\r\n                              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n                      \r\n            <div class=\"col-span-6 md:col-span-2 rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-black\">\r\n              <div\r\n                class=\"h-[300px] flex flex-col justify-end p-6 bg-cover bg-center\"\r\n                style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.7), rgba(0,0,0,0.2)), url('/cms/footerads/kids.png'); background-position: right top;\"\r\n              >\r\n                                  <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-white\">\r\n                    Perfect for a day out with the kids                  </h3>\r\n                \r\n                                  <p class=\"text-sm mb-4 text-white\">\r\n                    Best movies and treats for all                  </p>\r\n                \r\n                                  <a\r\n                    href=\"/cinema/kids\"\r\n                    class=\"text-center font-semibold bg-white/20 hover:bg-white/30 transition px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-sm w-full text-white\"\r\n                  >\r\n                     See our Kids offerings                  </a>\r\n                              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n       \r\n<div id=\"footerContact\" class=\"bg-[#282828] mt-8\">\r\n  <div class=\"w-full text-center py-8\">\r\n    <h4 class=\"text-ompYellow text-2xl font-bold\">Need help?</h4>\r\n    <p class=\"\">Get in touch with your local cinema now:</p>\r\n    <div class=\"input-container mb-4 main-container mt-4\">\r\n      <div class=\"input-select mx-auto w-full md:w-2/3 lg:w-1/2\">\r\n        <select id=\"conactlocalCinema\" name=\"sitecode\" cl